        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>CalleeRepairCBTy</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::Attributor::ArgumentReplacementInfo::CalleeRepairCBTy</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Callee repair callback type. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The function repair callback is invoked once to rewire the replacement arguments in the body of the new function. The argument replacement info is passed, as build from the registerFunctionSignatureRewrite call, as well as the replacement function and an iteratore to the first replacement argument. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
