    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper struct used in the communication between an abstract attribute (<ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_a_a" kindref="compound">AA</ref>) that wants to change the signature of a function and the <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_attributor" kindref="compound">Attributor</ref> which applies the changes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The struct is partially initialized with the information from the <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_a_a" kindref="compound">AA</ref> (see the constructor). All other members are provided by the <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_attributor" kindref="compound">Attributor</ref> prior to invoking any callbacks. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
